### 5. **ClientsStorage для анонимов (WSS):**

```php
// AuthorizedClientsStorage.php - переименовываем в ClientsStorage
class ClientsStorage implements ClientsStorageInterface
{
    private array $clients = [];

    // Для авторизованных
    public function add(ConnectionInterface $conn, UserData $userData): void
    {
        $this->clients[$conn->resourceId] = [
            'connection' => $conn,
            'user_data' => $userData,
            'guest_id' => null,
            'type' => 'user',
        ];
    }

    // Для гостей
    public function addGuest(ConnectionInterface $conn, string $guestId, ?string $name = null): void
    {
        $this->clients[$conn->resourceId] = [
            'connection' => $conn,
            'user_data' => null,
            'guest_id' => $guestId,
            'guest_name' => $name ?? 'Guest ' . substr($guestId, 0, 8),
            'type' => 'guest',
        ];
